    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Lich khrusos.</em> A lich that traded its phylactery for a golden cocoon — it fights entirely through a silk puppet woven around a stolen corpse (AC 21 and Resistance to all damage while the puppet lives, Stealth +11 for the puppet). Destroy the cocoon and it simply spins a new one. Habitat: Mountain &amp; The Low.</p><p><em>Source: @UUID[Compendium.helianas-mechanics.field-notes-library.JournalEntry.OInRhP8Rwd7NDpQp]{Heliana's Field Notes X-48 (Loot Tavern)}</em></p>",
