      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The chrysalich's puppet is an extension of the chrysalich and isn't considered a separate creature, but has its own pool of 50 Hit Points when it's created and can't regain Hit Points. It uses the chrysalich's statistics, except it has a Dexterity score of 20 and a Speed of 35 feet. The chrysalich can take actions through the puppet and expend movement to move it. If the puppet is ever more than 10 miles from the chrysalich, it immediately decays and is destroyed.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
